  "releaseNotes": "* Added support for async methods compiled with the runtime-async feature.\n* Added InitHelpers and AsyncHelpers to ignored types on .NET 10 and later.\n* Added a .NET 10 target.\n* System.__Canon is now shown as a '?'.\n* Fixed duplicated generic arguments on nested types.\n* Fixed empty line when no source data is available but source data is turned on.\n* TypeInitializationExceptions now append the static constructor to the top of the stack trace.",
